{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["<b>And your cord.</b> A cord-band worn upon you, like the sash about the loins that the Sages described. She chose these particular objects because they signify greatness and might — the seal of authority, the staff of rulership, and the sash, as it says: אֱזֹר נָא כְגֶבֶר חֲלָצֶיךָ (Job 38:3). And she did this so that she might reflect upon the excellence and greatness of Judah."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 38, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:33:49.856466083Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}